## 3c. Partial-lead consent (required before any number is stored)
- **existing-customers:** already has the `contact_ok` checkbox → nothing to add. A number is stored only once it is ticked.
- **landing-v2 (`<dialog id="lead">`):** has no consent control. Add under the phone field, then add `data-f360-partial-notice="1"` to the `<form>`:
  `<small class="f360-notice">بكتابة رقمك توافق على أن يتواصل معك فريق فندقة بخصوص عرض فندقة 360. <a href="https://fandaqah.com/store/policy">إشعار الخصوصية</a></small>`
  Without the attribute, v2 sends only the anonymous Meta micro event and stores nothing.
- Env: `F360_PARTIAL_DIR` (outside web root, writable), optional `F360_CRM_PARTIAL_WEBHOOK`, `F360_PARTIAL_DAYS` (default 30).
- Have the privacy notice / legal owner confirm the wording against PDPL before go-live.

